    scenario: "A BCBA is conducting a functional behavior assessment for a 3-year-old girl with autism who engages in frequent crying and dropping to the floor during transitions between activities in a preschool setting. The BCBA conducts 4 sessions of ABC recording and finds that dropping occurs in 100% of transitions, regardless of the specific activities involved, the time of day, or the staff member present. The consequence is always that the transition is delayed while staff attempt to prompt the girl to stand up.",
