    scenario: "A BCBA is conducting a functional analysis for a 12-year-old student with autism and intellectual disability who engages in aggression. The BCBA implements the standard four-condition FA. After 3 sessions of each condition, the data shows: attention = 0.5 responses per minute, escape = 0.5 responses per minute, tangible = 0.5 responses per minute, alone = 0.5 responses per minute. All conditions show similar, low rates of aggression.",
